This is a Minecraft mod project using SpongePowered Mixins + MixinExtras.

When writing, reviewing, or debugging mixin code, read the **mixin-writing** skill first.

When searching dependency/vanilla/mod sources, checking bytecode, investigating class
hierarchies, or diagnosing mixin conflicts, read the **mixinmcp-tools** skill first.
ALWAYS prefer MixinMCP tools (on the `user-jetbrains` MCP server) over grep, read_file,
or jar extraction. MixinMCP indexes the entire classpath including inside dependency jars
(which grep cannot see), provides dedicated type hierarchy, call graph, and reference-finding
tools that are faster and more accurate than text search, and returns clean, structured
results that use less context than raw file dumps.
